{"parentUuid":"3f133944-e566-430c-8094-7f4649772166","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"9248d1c4-b40a-485b-bea6-15e6c3184d7e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01W8ktQeiTFyGZXN8ktJiekj","type":"tool_result","content":"141\n1:# Adversarial review of BRAIN-SPEEDUPS.md\n10:## Preflight (recorded once)\n21:## Per-item verdicts\n43:## #6 detail: what #474 fixes, and what it does not\n71:## Missed items\n83:## Corrected ranking (user-visible impact × frequency × certainty)\n86:2. **M1 (with the #6 lock part).** Agents' brief and MCP calls fail with `brain_locked` during long writes, and the first MCP call pays about 3.4 s. Use a shared lock or a snapshot read for retrieval, and keep writer critical sections short.\n87:3. **M2 + #5 + M3.** Build the FTS in the writer that changed history (or incrementally), with a large `cache_size`. Do not move it into setup's critical path.\n101:## Re-measurement log (isolated, ≤ 3 reps each)\n107:| M1 lock contention | 2 baseline + 1 CLI + 1 MCP | baseline 1,202 / 536 ms; held lock: CLI rc=1 at 10,544 ms; MCP `brain_locked` at 10,578 ms |\n114:## Tool-usage log (graph and brain)\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/suhaan/devenv","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"729079aa-4fa2-4b39-b275-1d0a61b63c34","timestamp":"2026-10-24T18:06:28.323Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"141\n1:# Adversarial review of BRAIN-SPEEDUPS.md\n10:## Preflight (recorded once)\n21:## Per-item verdicts\n43:## #6 detail: what #474 fixes, and what it does not\n71:## Missed items\n83:## Corrected ranking (user-visible impact × frequency × certainty)\n86:2. **M1 (with the #6 lock part).** Agents' brief and MCP calls fail with `brain_locked` during long writes, and the first MCP call pays about 3.4 s. Use a shared lock or a snapshot read for retrieval, and keep writer critical sections short.\n87:3. **M2 + #5 + M3.** Build the FTS in the writer that changed history (or incrementally), with a large `cache_size`. Do not move it into setup's critical path.\n101:## Re-measurement log (isolated, ≤ 3 reps each)\n107:| M1 lock contention | 2 baseline + 1 CLI + 1 MCP | baseline 1,202 / 536 ms; held lock: CLI rc=1 at 10,544 ms; MCP `brain_locked` at 10,578 ms |\n114:## Tool-usage log (graph and brain)","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/suhaan/devenv","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"classifierBoundary":true,"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"aa638578-5ade-4e95-9f8e-c7f005de6fdd","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","root":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","branch":"main","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":1,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":282},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"private"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"private"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"private"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/cli","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-graph","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"3f133944-e566-430c-8094-7f4649772166","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"6e41b4d8-b432-41b0-bc86-517a25b228fa","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
