7.70 | 2.86 | 2.70x |\n  | subdir | 1.28 | 0.91 | |\n  | def / neighbors / impact cold | ~20.2-20.4 | ~11.8 | 1.71-1.73x |\n  | def / neighbors / impact warm | 0.55 | 0.53-0.59 | ~parity |\n  | snapshot / edges warm | 19.99 / 19.72 | 0.29 / 0.62 | |\n  | working-tree query | 8.70 | 5.14 | |\n  | parallel x3 | 12.66, 3 builds | 17.79, 1 build | **0.71x** |\n  \n  **entire-graph**\n  - OLD **HANGS (>120 s, killed, 2/2 reps)** on every graph-building verb: index, query cold, def, neighbors, impact, snapshot/symbols/edges cold, working-tree query, parallel. Only setup (0.07 s) and diff (1.29 s) work, and both are at parity with NEW.\n  - NEW:\n    - index 20.58 (load 12-15; 10.81 s later at load ~6)\n    - query cold 22.75 (I15323 P4818 Q1555)\n    - warm diff 3.52, 2nd worktree 3.77\n    - **exact-name `SearchRepository` 354.98 s (370 / 338 / 355; Preselect 333-365 s)**\n    - def / neighbors cold 10.18 / 10.58, warm 0.40 / 0.40 (re-measured)\n    - impact 10.38 / 0.41\n    - records cold ~10, warm 0.08-0.34\n  - **Global stats** (7d, `--no-cache`): OLD 2.63, NEW 3.14 (**0.84x**).\n  \n  ### RSS and cache size (cold index)\n  | repo | peak RSS OLD → NEW | cache OLD → NEW | NEW with sqlite store (`ENTIRE_GRAPH_SEARCH_STORE=1`) |\n  |---|---|---|---|\n  | cli | 1004 → 432 MB | 5.48 → 5.81 MB | 126.4 MB |\n  | brain | 1160 → 604 MB | 7.05 → 7.37 MB | 196.0 MB |\n  | entiredb | 1020 → 506 MB | 6.86 → 7.28 MB | 153.8 MB |\n  | entire-graph | OLD hung | NEW 3.49 MB, 281 MB RSS | 68.8 MB |\n  \n  - The sqlite store makes the cache 18-27x larger.\n  - The store is only written when that env var is set. Without it, `store` and `context` return `store_unavailable`.\n  \n  ### 5 slowest on NEW and what dominates each\n  1. **Exact-name query, entire-graph: 355 s.** Preselect is one `git grep -E -m 1 -f - <commit>` (the alias ERE route).\n     - On cli the same call is 7893 ms wall and 61.5 s of git CPU. The `-F -i -l` route takes ~40 ms.\n  2. **Cold query: 16-23 s.** It runs a p