{"parentUuid":"303f5628-6208-46ad-b2a6-7c8eb705d500","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"1c9c3a4e-5800-4e8c-8732-5729bcb75c37","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MYY2qJNqnSYGLPD1UjEYcL","type":"tool_result","content":"Install the coding-agent guide into AGENTS.md/CLAUDE.md\n\nUsage:\n  entire graph setup [--repo path] [--strict | --normal] [--no-claude-hook]\n\nWrites one shared operating guide and managed AGENTS.md/CLAUDE.md references. Preserves repository Graph/Brain activation and the saved guidance mode. --strict saves mandatory tool-use rules for all enabled products; --normal resets to normal guidance. New repositories default to normal.\n\nAlso registers a Claude Code SubagentStart hook (entire graph hook claude-subagent-start) in the per-user, untracked .claude/settings.local.json, merged into existing settings and added once. Claude Code's Explore and Plan subagents do not load CLAUDE.md; the hook gives them the graph directive. --no-claude-hook skips it.\n\nFlags:\n  --repo <path>      Repository to install into (default: current repo)\n  --strict           Save strict guidance for all enabled products (exclusive with --normal)\n  --normal           Save normal guidance for all enabled products (exclusive with --strict)\n  --no-claude-hook   Do not register the Claude Code SubagentStart hook in .claude/settings.local.json\n\nExamples:\n  entire graph setup --repo .\n== entire-graph\n?? .brainignore\n?? .claude/worktrees/main\n== entire-brain\n M .claude/settings.json\n M .entire/agent-guide.mdHEAD\n== entiredb\n M .claude/settings.json\n?? .DS_Store\n?? .brainignore\n?? .cursor/\n?? .gemini/main\n14:23  up 1 day,  2:34, 9 users, load averages: 4.97 5.40 5.51","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"bc24dd01-b0cf-47ec-a808-88bb62f725a2","timestamp":"2026-10-24T18:23:11.149Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"Install the coding-agent guide into AGENTS.md/CLAUDE.md\n\nUsage:\n  entire graph setup [--repo path] [--strict | --normal] [--no-claude-hook]\n\nWrites one shared operating guide and managed AGENTS.md/CLAUDE.md references. Preserves repository Graph/Brain activation and the saved guidance mode. --strict saves mandatory tool-use rules for all enabled products; --normal resets to normal guidance. New repositories default to normal.\n\nAlso registers a Claude Code SubagentStart hook (entire graph hook claude-subagent-start) in the per-user, untracked .claude/settings.local.json, merged into existing settings and added once. Claude Code's Explore and Plan subagents do not load CLAUDE.md; the hook gives them the graph directive. --no-claude-hook skips it.\n\nFlags:\n  --repo <path>      Repository to install into (default: current repo)\n  --strict           Save strict guidance for all enabled products (exclusive with --normal)\n  --normal           Save normal guidance for all enabled products (exclusive with --strict)\n  --no-claude-hook   Do not register the Claude Code SubagentStart hook in .claude/settings.local.json\n\nExamples:\n  entire graph setup --repo .\n== entire-graph\n?? .brainignore\n?? .claude/worktrees/main\n== entire-brain\n M .claude/settings.json\n M .entire/agent-guide.mdHEAD\n== entiredb\n M .claude/settings.json\n?? .DS_Store\n?? .brainignore\n?? .cursor/\n?? .gemini/main\n14:23  up 1 day,  2:34, 9 users, load averages: 4.97 5.40 5.51","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"classifierBoundary":true,"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"30df37ba-bae1-4b04-bf35-1e285e241a6e","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","root":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","branch":"main","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":2},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-graph","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"entireio","host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entir