{"parentUuid":"e67e61d7-3545-4546-81bc-c8b6297b6649","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14733676 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"97c84101-fa4d-4fd5-a047-841b93398d17","timestamp":"2026-10-24T18:27:22.057Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14733676 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6e41b4d8-b432-41b0-bc86-517a25b228fa","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
{"parentUuid":"97c84101-fa4d-4fd5-a047-841b93398d17","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgMXvw819oJgrPNTL557q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The Brain session finished re-indexing, and the graph setup and prewarm (B3) are done. The second agent is still checking the graph fix list against the code, now with the machine quiet enough to time things. Fixing starts when it reports.\n\n**Brain re-index**\n- **entire-graph:** done in 25.7 s. It had been refusing completely, because Claude Code's nested worktrees made the repo look dirty. The Brain session added an untracked ignore file there to unblock itself.\n- **entiredb:** 90% done in about 4 minutes. Only the graph's code index failed, because entiredb is a partial clone.\n- **entire-brain:** blocked by one 446 MB session transcript. That's the Brain session's to fix.\n\n**Graph setup and prewarm**\n\n| Repo | Setup | Prewarm |\n|---|---|---|\n| entire-graph | guide already current | cache already warm, 1.3 s |\n| entire-brain | guide updated to the current graph search command | built in 14.9 s |\n| entiredb | guide and subagent hook added | refused: partial clone |\n\nRe-running setup reports \"already current\" in all three, so there are no duplicate markers. I backed up every file setup touched before running it.\n\n**Partial-clone bug moved up my list.** It blocks two of the four main repos (cli and entiredb), not just cli. The graph's own error message promises to fall back to reading files from disk, but that fallback is never reached, so that's where the fix goes. The safety check that refuses to run git there is correct and stays.\n\n**New PR:** [#370](https://github.com/entireio/entire-graph/pull/370), a one-line `.gitignore` entry for Claude Code's nested worktrees. Those worktrees are what made Brain refuse entire-graph. It's open and not merged.\n\nI briefly set that commit's author to your account email by hand. I caught it and amended it to your GitHub noreply address before pushing, so your email was never published.\n\nThe Brain session also reported a privacy bug: a failed `privacy exclude` can leave a session excluded with no command to undo it. It recovered its own case and logged both defects on its board."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":608,"cache_read_input_tokens":248017,"output_tokens":697,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":608,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":697,"cache_read_input_tokens":248017,"cache_creation_input_tokens":608,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":608},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"1ad04574-9d51-427c-b53c-02fc71991d98","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgMXvvotzqbV96Rxqc1Nt","requestRef":"a68d09af-be30-407b-8b2f-3149dc363d11","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"b0bfb4db-ede2-43f5-adbb-0573bbf9be0b","timestamp":"2026-10-24T18:27:31.024Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","session_id":"6e41b4d8-b432-41b0-bc86-517a25b228fa","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
