{"parentUuid":"28b1f05b-72be-482d-958a-e8caec402512","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgMa1JRGa3uYBUxm3UEzP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011rnHUnoVYyHD4CnNECyZdU","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='/Users/suhaan/devenv-worktrees/process-map/process-map.html'\ns=open(p).read()\ndef rep(a,b):\n    global s\n    assert s.count(a)==1, a[:70]; s=s.replace(a,b)\nrep('''<div class=\"callout\"><b>One exact-name search took 6 minutes.</b> Searching entire-graph for a bare identifier (<span class=\"mono\">SearchRepository</span>) took 355 s, almost all of it in one <span class=\"mono\">git grep</span> with a regex alternation over the whole commit. The same route costs 8 s on cli, where a fixed-string search takes about 40 ms.</div>''',\n'''<div class=\"callout\"><b>One search took 6 minutes.</b> Searching entire-graph for <span class=\"mono\">SearchRepository</span> took 355 s. The word \"Repository\" has an abbreviation alias (\"repo\"), and on a cache hit that route runs one regex <span class=\"mono\">git grep</span> over the whole commit. 97% of the time goes on 226 MB of generated parser files the graph never indexes. Skipping those makes it about 1.3 s with identical results. The same route costs 45 s on entire-brain and 8 s on cli.</div>''')\nrep('<p class=\"note\">Ranked by saving per working session (one cold query plus about ten warm commands). A reviewer is checking each against the source now. Each fix becomes its own PR, with an old/new timing taken on a quiet machine and a check that output is unchanged.</p>',\n    '<p class=\"note\">In the order the reviewer corrected it to, after checking every item against the source and re-measuring the key ones. Each fix becomes its own PR, with an old/new timing taken on a quiet machine and a byte-for-byte check that output is unchanged. The first three are in progress.</p>')\ni=s.index('const GFIXES = ['); j=s.index('];',i)+2\ns=s[:i]+'''const GFIXES = [\n  [\"Alias search: keep the same regex, but only grep files the graph indexes, and list matching files instead of lines\", \"entire-graph 355 s → about 1.3 s; entire-brain 45 s → 2.5 s; cli 7.8 s → 0.9 s\", \"big\", \"in progress; measured on git alone, identical by construction\"],\n  [\"Let the indexing pipeline run ahead of a slow file (wider ordered window, ordering kept)\", \"cold index −26% (cli) to −33% (brain); every cold command\", \"meas\", \"in progress; reviewer's rebuilt version passes the existing tests, identical output\"],\n  [\"Index partial clones when git can be stopped from fetching (git 2.45 and later)\", \"unblocks cli and entiredb for the graph and Brain; their queries stop rebuilding uncached every time\", \"big\", \"in progress; the safety guard stays for older git\"],\n  [\"Splice new history into the cache in place instead of re-sorting it on every hit\", \"−0.15 to −0.18 s per warm command; fixes the slowdown\", \"est\", \"adjusted: remembering it per commit is unsafe\"],\n  [\"Stop writing the derived selective view on every new warm question\", \"−0.5 to −0.7 s per new question\", \"est\", \"confirmed; nothing else reads it\"],\n  [\"First query uses the same file selection as a warm one\", \"about −3.9 s (cli), −5.5 s (brain) per first query; first and later answers become identical\", \"est\", \"adjusted: not free, today the first answer differs from later ones\"],\n  [\"Tool-handler detection: look at identifiers, not string contents\", \"removes about 54 false \\\\\"tool\\\\\" symbols on entire-brain\", \"est\", \"confirmed, wider than one symbol\"],\n  [\"Say when function references passed as values are not modelled\", \"neighbors stops silently reporting 0 callers\", \"est\", \"confirmed; full support needs a schema change\"],\n  [\"Run the HTTP route passes inside the parallel scan\", \"−0.8 to −1.4 s per cold build\", \"est\", \"plausible\"],\n  [\"Cheaper sort and source prep\", \"small\", \"est\", \"partly wrong: one re-read is a safety check and stays\"],\n  [\"Precompute ranking token variants\", \"−0.3 to −0.6 s per warm query\", \"est\", \"overstated\"],\n  [\"Replace per-pattern regex in relation extraction with one shared pass\", \"−1 to −2 s per cold build\", \"est\", \"overstated; high output risk\"],\n];'''+s[j:]\nrep(' A second agent checked the Brain fix list against the source; the Graph list is being checked now.</p>',' A second agent checked both fix lists against the source before any work started.</p>')\nopen(p,'w').write(s); print('ok')\nEOF\nnode -e \"const fs=require('fs');const h=fs.readFileSync('/Users/suhaan/devenv-worktrees/process-map/process-map.html','utf8');new Function(h.split('<script>')[1].split('</script>')[0]);console.log('js ok')\"","description":"Update the artifact Graph tab with review verdicts"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1114,"cache_read_input_tokens":265395,"output_tokens":1983,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":127},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1114,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1983,"cache_read_input_tokens":265395,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1114,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1114},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_011rnHUnoVYyHD4CnNECyZdU":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='/Users/suhaan/devenv-worktrees/process-map/process-map.html'\ns=open(p).read()\ndef rep(a,b):\n    global s\n    assert s.count(a)==1, a[:70]; s=s.replace(a,b)\nrep('''<div class=\"callout\"><b>One exact-name search took 6 minutes.</b> Se