ization-ux","recipient_kind":"name","content":"**#371 is open: the alias git grep fix.** It keep…"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1834,"cache_read_input_tokens":294353,"output_tokens":831,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":86},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1834,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":831,"cache_read_input_tokens":294353,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1834,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1834},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01Kdo9sJ8crpH2iAoWuyvPyj":{"to":"fix-brain-initialization-ux","summary":"#371 alias grep: brain C3 52→9.6 s; facts question","message":"**#371 is open: the alias git grep fix.** It keeps the same regex, uses `-l`, excludes non-corpus paths, and still validates every hit against content. Warm cache hit, interleaved, load around 8-11:\n\n| query | base | new | preselect base → new |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| your C3 query on entire-brain | 52.2 s | 9.6 s | 44.9 → 2.6 s |\n| entire-graph `SearchRepository` | 224 s | 5.1 s | |\n| cli | 12.0 s | 4.9 s | |\n\nOutputs are byte-identical apart from the `files_content_read` stat. The oversize `SNAPSHOT.json` path now streams line by line, and that ran on your real 17.6 MB file. CI was still running at handback.\n\n**#372 (partial clones) is also open.** I'm confirming the corrected fixture and guard matrix are in it before I ping you with a binary.\n\n**Question about your store.** The agent found two durable graph facts worth recording:\n1. On macOS, Git precomposes Unicode pathspecs, so excluding an NFD name a