{"parentUuid":"b1d0a916-2b8e-4e2f-9b37-071a83641bb5","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14685252 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"64cd223d-d700-4083-a9d1-833a52bd5a79","timestamp":"2026-10-24T19:54:09.433Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14685252 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6e41b4d8-b432-41b0-bc86-517a25b228fa","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
{"parentUuid":"64cd223d-d700-4083-a9d1-833a52bd5a79","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgMeYo7kSkLr8Fk7u7kJd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The first speed fix is up: [#371](https://github.com/entireio/entire-graph/pull/371), the alias search.\n\n| Repo | Before | After |\n|---|---|---|\n| entire-graph | 224 s | 5.1 s |\n| entire-brain | 52 s | 9.6 s |\n| cli | 12 s | 4.9 s |\n\n- **Same results:** outputs are byte-identical apart from one stats counter. There is one stated change for files over 4 MB: they now count as a match if any line matches, where before only the first matching line counted.\n- **Tested:** nine deliberate breakages each made a test fail. One of those caught a Windows-only bug in the agent's own test setup before CI did.\n- **CI:** the build passes on all three OSes. The full test suites and the agent review were still running when the agent handed back.\n\nThe partial-clone fix is also open, as [#372](https://github.com/entireio/entire-graph/pull/372). Before I count it as done, I'm confirming it includes the corrected safety test.\n\n**Fixed in my setup**\n- **`flock` isn't installed** on this Mac. My protocol told agents to use it, so I added a small replacement and pointed the protocol at it. I also told the two agents still running to redo any timing that ran without the lock.\n- **Shared scratch folder:** the agents shared one, and one agent's PR description briefly overwrote another's. It was restored within a minute, and agents now keep scratch files in their own worktrees.\n\n**Something for your list (not my area):** each time an agent commits in a repo with Entire enabled, Entire's post-commit hook uses 2.8 GB of memory and a full CPU core running `entire checkpoint explain`. That's the same per-checkpoint pattern that makes Brain's cli setup take hours. It slows every commit, so it's worth a CLI issue."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1011,"cache_read_input_tokens":296187,"output_tokens":605,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1011,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":605,"cache_read_input_tokens":296187,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1011,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1011},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"789e59cc-ee80-4843-b466-37f76ef4b60f","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgMeYno9PHzRfEzqjRu8j","requestRef":"89e71507-d847-4406-ae4b-771c50b5aa72","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"09a5519a-eab9-485f-b2cd-074ecc7cd819","timestamp":"2026-10-24T19:54:17.427Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","session_id":"6e41b4d8-b432-41b0-bc86-517a25b228fa","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
