{"parentUuid":"aa4cd736-0694-4303-a535-9074dcf29c96","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgMegXMh5gYUVkTPgepAq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2129,"cache_read_input_tokens":301654,"output_tokens":457,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":59},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2129,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":457,"cache_read_input_tokens":301654,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2129,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2129},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":4757,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"2e4515c2-53af-41ca-9912-1beaf5697c59","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgMegX3b6xXp1wuwYjUnp","requestRef":"4e1531f0-dd23-441d-bf3b-4a62746f9045","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"da7ef39a-eeb4-4504-aeed-355fee3dbfb6","timestamp":"2026-10-24T19:56:01.364Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","session_id":"6e41b4d8-b432-41b0-bc86-517a25b228fa","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
{"parentUuid":"da7ef39a-eeb4-4504-aeed-355fee3dbfb6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgMegXMh5gYUVkTPgepAq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I recorded two lessons in entire-graph's Brain memory and checked that `recall` returns both:\n- On macOS, excluding a file path that contains non-English letters can also exclude a different file whose name looks identical, so only plain-ASCII paths are safe to exclude.\n- `flock` isn't installed on this machine, so timing runs use the replacement lock script.\n\nThe Brain session also passed on a lesson from its own PR: CI runs the tests with Go's race detector, which it had never run locally. A \"green\" locally then failed in CI with a data race in production code. The race was code reading a git command's error output before the command had finished.\n\n- That's now a rule for all fix agents: run the focused tests with the race detector before trusting a pass.\n- When CI fails across lots of unrelated tests, they check the log for `DATA RACE` before blaming the machine.\n- The partial-clone agent was warned about that exact bug pattern, since its change touches how git commands are launched.\n\n**CI so far:** #371 has 22 checks passing, with the macOS and Windows test runs still going and nothing failed yet. I'm still holding back the test binary for the Brain session's entiredb re-index until #372's safety test and race-detector run are confirmed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2129,"cache_read_input_tokens":301654,"output_tokens":457,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":59},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2129,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":457,"cache_read