{"parentUuid":"7222cd62-12d9-4f31-ac2a-2492dcbb1af8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgMf8rqCCa98vTfdRP9pt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The pipeline-speedup agent is finishing up.\n\n**Done so far**\n- The code and tests are written.\n- 50 repeated runs under the race detector all pass.\n- Nine deliberate breakages each made a test fail.\n\n**First timings** (one run each):\n\n| Repo | Before | After |\n|---|---|---|\n| cli | 11.9 s | 8.7 s (−26%) |\n| entire-brain | 15.9 s | 10.4 s (−34%) |\n| entire-graph | 11.6 s | 7.5 s (−35%) |\n\nMemory use stays within about 7%. A sweep of window sizes shows the gain levels off at 16×, which is the value chosen.\n\n**Before the PR opens**, it still has to:\n- take three timing runs per repo and use the middle one;\n- confirm the index output is byte-identical on all four repos;\n- confirm warm queries are no slower.\n\nThe partial-clone agent is still finishing its safety proof for #372."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":495,"cache_read_input_tokens":308853,"output_tokens":316,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":495,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":316,"cache_read_input_tokens":308853,"cache_creation_input_tokens":495,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":495},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"1df9562e-a416-4d39-8063-3bdcf3280b23","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgMf8rTct1eCTXtaqz9NU","requestRef":"55699800-9913-4c7e-bd7a-c7c64318a853","requestedModel":"cla