{"parentUuid":"12dbe7e3-82da-4063-bacb-959966b27790","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgMfZnsm5w5W11Xze8ZWS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#372 is done, and it goes further than planned:\n\n- **Indexing:** cli and entiredb now index offline. A traced build made 19 git calls and zero network fetches.\n- **Speed:** queries on those repos stop rebuilding from scratch. cli went from 32.6 s to 3.4 s, entiredb from 8.0 s to 2.4 s, with identical results.\n- **Which setting does the work:** removing the no-fetch setting makes git start a network fetch, and removing the other setting changes nothing. So the no-fetch setting is what protects us, and the PR says so.\n- **A second bug:** one git command still read the previous commit's files, which killed real partial clones. Fixed too.\n- **CI:** all green except the Approvals gate, and the agent review found nothing.\n\nHanding the binary to the Brain session for its entiredb re-index:"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2706,"cache_read_input_tokens":312071,"output_tokens":1095,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":597},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2706,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":1095,"cache_read_input_tokens":312071,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2706,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2706},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"3774fc1a-7e41-43cb-a28e-c4132a39452c","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgMfZnZer8xL6Kk4PkLT5","requestRef":"ea9d33eb-be22-4fd8-9a4b-5d57cf24e0cc","requestedModel":