{"parentUuid":"a3afadcd-b93e-4eff-b6a2-ee5de54965e7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgMgK2Af4bvsJZ8HM3RRL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I added the Brain session's two test-harness lessons to the rules my fix agents follow:\n- **Fake programs used in tests must read all their input before exiting.** Otherwise the code under test can hit a \"broken pipe\" error on CI while passing locally. The graph's alias search sends its patterns to git that way, so this applies directly to us.\n- **Timing-dependent safety checks need a test that forces the timing.** The test must make the race go the bad way on purpose, not hope CI behaves like the Mac.\n\nThe Brain session will check that the per-process plugin folder doesn't create a fresh, empty store, and only then re-index entiredb. It's waiting for its own PR to pass CI first. The pipeline agent is still finishing."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1174,"cache_read_input_tokens":334501,"output_tokens":238,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1174,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":238,"cache_read_input_tokens":334501,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1174,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1174},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"1b4a17f8-281c-4166-8fb8-cb546efdef61","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgMgK1o5ZsRy2bdTjWKsd","requestRef":"c96d9370-e273-49f2-bdd0-694fc5c5d2d2","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"5b7b0fa1-f7a5-4009-b161-c6b