mbols from the tool-handler heuristic\nRead row C2 of `/Users/suhaan/devenv-worktrees/timing/GRAPH-SPEEDUPS-REVIEW.md` in full first.\n\n**Today.**\n- `looksLikeToolHandler` (provider.go:28824) uses a bag of tokens that INCLUDES string literals. So a function whose vocabulary contains \"tool\" and \"schema\" (for example entire-brain's `historyTerms`, history.go:2442) is emitted as a synthetic `kind=tool` symbol via syntheticBoundarySymbols (:2181).\n- That makes `impact`/`def` ambiguous (a duplicate definition).\n- Counts: entire-brain 56 tool symbols, entire-graph 22 (SymbolRecord, searchRepository, main, tests…), cli 5. The reviewer estimates at most 2 are genuine.\n\n**Fix direction:** decide on identifier-only tokens, a real registration signal (for example an MCP/tool registration call, or a handler signature), or both. Then:\n- run `entire brain recall` and `git log -S looksLikeToolHandler` first, to learn what genuine cases it was built for;\n- keep every genuine case;\n- run `entire graph impact` on `looksLikeToolHandler` and on syntheticBoundarySymbols.\n\n**This changes output intentionally.**\n- Produce a per-repo table (entire-brain, entire-graph, cli, entiredb clones in `timing/repos/`) of tool symbols before vs after, each one classified genuine or false. Put it in the PR body.\n- Check whether the snapshot/cache identity needs a version bump so stale caches don't keep the old symbols. Find how producer changes invalidate caches (identity_revision / schema), and follow the existing convention.\n\n## Done means\n- Tests:\n  - historyTerms-style false positive gone;\n  - genuine handler kept;\n  - each weakened to red.\n- `entire graph def historyTerms` (via `bin/new`, fresh cache) on entire-brain is no longer ambiguous.\n- PR open, CI watched, and the report per the protocol.\n\nBranch `fix/tool-handler-heuristic`, worktree `/Users/suhaan/devenv-worktrees/eg-tool-heuristic`.","outputFile":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-suhaan-devenv/6e41b4d8-b432-41b0-bc86-517a25b228fa/tasks/aff5f71fd4fb9f439.output","canReadOutputFile":true,"canContinueAgent":true},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"22ceceec-75cc-4851-b0c4-912db93b1aab","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","root":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","branch":"main","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":2},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-graph","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"entireio","host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-graph","visibility":"public"},{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-graph","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"private"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/cli","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-graph","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"14f72837-fb80-4772-b21a-d828fe3e8996","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"6e41b4d8-b432-41b0-bc86-517a25b228fa","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
