{"parentUuid":"dcb0d336-4e7c-47c1-95aa-c2f5d208c85b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgMhBXGmR96yJjFGNPGFE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"entiredb is now fully indexed in Brain using the #372 build. Its numbers (36,068 symbols, 2,542 files) match the graph's own index exactly.\n\n**What I cleaned up**\n- I removed the temporary link the Brain session made into your real Brain data, now that the re-index is done. Left in place, any later run using that test folder would have written into your real store. Only the link was removed; your data is intact.\n- I recorded the lesson in my notes: the plugin-folder override also moves Brain's data store.\n\n**Where the repos stand**\n- **entire-graph and entiredb:** done.\n- **cli:** no longer blocked on the graph side. It still waits on the Brain session's fix for the slow per-checkpoint export.\n- **entire-brain:** waiting on a decision about how to handle very large transcripts (446 MB in one session).\n\n#373 has 21 checks passing and none failed, with the full test runs still going. I told that agent to stop re-posting its report every time CI moves, and I'm tracking it myself. Wave 2's three agents are working."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":898,"cache_read_input_tokens":358794,"output_tokens":346,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":898,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":346,"cache_read_input_tokens":358794,"cache_creation_input_tokens":898,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":898},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics"