back count after request 2 = 1, want 2\" and \"warm search persisted its derived selective view\". Restore checked with cmp.\n- **CI:** 34 pass, 1 fail (Entire Gates, Approvals only), 0 running.\n\n**Local checks:** focused `-race` runs under mlock were green for both (sem for both, plus cli focused for B). `GOEXPERIMENT=nojsonv2` cache tests green for both. vet and `gofmt -s` clean. A and B merge cleanly with each other (`git merge-tree`).\n\n**Not done or unconfirmed:**\n- **Agent review:** the Findings sub-gate passed with 0 findings on trails 288 and 289. With no review comments on either PR, I can't confirm the review actually ran.\n- **Brain memory:** I did not run `entire brain remember`, because it writes to the shared Brain store, which the protocol says not to touch.\n- **Scratch files:** the timing scripts and logs are in each worktree's `.g3/` (for example `/Users/suhaan/devenv-worktrees/eg-selective-view/.g3/m/times.log`). They and the binaries in `bin/` are not committed.\n\nWorktrees: `/Users/suhaan/devenv-worktrees/eg-history-splice`, `/Users/suhaan/devenv-worktrees/eg-selective-view`."},"promptSource":"system","queueSkipSlashCommands":true,"turnOrigin":"peer","queueSkipAttachments":true,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
