{"parentUuid":"efb8defa-02eb-44a3-8c29-4ad6b3612815","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgMuAYdzsApopgiakBFxc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both PRs are open with all CI green:\n\n| PR | Fix | Result |\n|---|---|---|\n| [#375](https://github.com/entireio/entire-graph/pull/375) | history splice | warm `def`/`neighbors`/`impact` now 0.44–0.52 s, down from 0.62–0.65 s; fixes the slowdown against the September build |\n| [#376](https://github.com/entireio/entire-graph/pull/376) | skip the derived-file write | warm queries 0.16–0.38 s faster, repeats included |\n\nOutput is byte-identical in both.\n\nThe agent raised one fair doubt: the agent-review gate shows \"0 findings\", but there are no review comments, so it can't tell whether the review actually ran. My notes flag exactly that trap, where a gate showing zero means no review happened. Checking:"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3244,"cache_read_input_tokens":381845,"output_tokens":942,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":512},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3244,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":942,"cache_read_input_tokens":381845,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3244,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3244},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.2.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"}],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"c047a622-0c17-4b6b-ade1-34aeb30e5795","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgMuAWn7yEwc8SVCnB42g","requestRef":"502a2bd3-27d0-4dbb-9e58-4ef6cd701549","requested