{"parentUuid":"e6c663e5-e9cb-45e5-8366-eec29c31f79f","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"d6b1d054-6323-43b9-9fce-5b62c16ffa5d","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VDVGUZhwwS3EAxGxbmMzN8","type":"tool_result","content":"A trail ties together the context for a branch. Use `entire trail` to view, create, update, or watch it; use `entire trail finding` to manage agent findings.\n\nCurrent repo: gh/entireio/entire-graph  (auto-detected from origin; pass --repo only for a DIFFERENT repo)\n\nSubcommands: approvals · approve · checkout · comment · create · delete · finding · list · request-changes · resume · show · update · watch\n             read-only: approvals, list, show, watch — others write\nNext:  entire agent-help trail <subcommand>\nManage a trail's agent-native findings.\n\nRunning 'entire trail finding' shows the finding dashboard for the current\nbranch's trail. Pass a trail selector (number, id, or branch) to inspect another\ntrail in the same repo. Use 'entire trail list --status any' when you need to\ndiscover a trail selector first.\n\nUsage:\n  entire trail finding [<trail>] [flags]\n  entire trail finding [command]\n\nAvailable Commands:\n  add         Create a finding on a trail\n  apply       Apply a finding's unified-diff suggestion\n  dismiss     Dismiss a finding\n  list        List findings for a trail\n  reopen      Reopen a finding\n  resolve     Resolve a finding\n  show        Show a finding\n  update      Update a finding's metadata","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"931debd6-5264-48bc-9a39-2196fbab8b80","timestamp":"2026-10-24T23:06:11.474Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"A trail ties together the context for a branch. Use `entire trail` to view, create, update, or watch it; use `entire trail finding` to manage agent findings.\n\nCurrent repo: gh/entireio/entire-graph  (auto-detected from origin; pass --repo only for a DIFFERENT repo)\n\nSubcommands: approvals · approve · checkout · comment · create · delete · finding · list · request-changes · resume · show · update · watch\n             read-only: approvals, list, show, watch — others write\nNext:  entire agent-help trail <subcommand>\nManage a trail's agent-native findings.\n\nRunning 'entire trail finding' shows the finding dashboard for the current\nbranch's trail. Pass a trail selector (number, id, or branch) to inspect another\ntrail in the same repo. Use 'entire trail list --status any' when you need to\ndiscover a trail selector first.\n\nUsage:\n  entire trail finding [<trail>] [flags]\n  entire trail finding [command]\n\nAvailable Commands:\n  add         Create a finding on a trail\n  apply       Apply a finding's unified-diff suggestion\n  dismiss     Dismiss a finding\n  list        List findings for a trail\n  reopen      Reopen a finding\n  resolve     Resolve a finding\n  show        Show a finding\n  update      Update a finding's metadata","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[],"moreFiles":0,"shared":true}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"c047a622-0c17-4b6b-ade1-34aeb30e5795","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","root":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","branch":"main","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":2},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-graph","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"entireio","host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-graph","visibility":"public"},{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-graph","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"private"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/cli","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-