{"parentUuid":"38183558-ab15-4d99-bd13-bc96768ea2cc","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgMv8YCG9kigdYyctVTS6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Tool detection is fixed in [#374](https://github.com/entireio/entire-graph/pull/374):\n- false \"tool\" symbols went from 84 to 3 across the four repos (one false positive remains, and it's disclosed);\n- it found one real handler the old code missed;\n- everything else in the index is unchanged;\n- all CI checks pass.\n\n**Your installed `entire` was out of date.** It was an August 19 dev build in `~/.local/bin`, and it can't resolve review findings. I replaced it with a clean build of today's cli `main`. The swap was safe for any hook already running, and the old one is saved as `~/.local/bin/entire.bak-20260819`. I told the Brain session, since it uses the same CLI.\n\n**One open review finding (on #377).**\n- **Why it was missed:** the new CLI numbers trails org-wide, while the gate links use per-repo numbers. With the wrong number, a findings check shows a confident zero.\n- **The re-check:** I looked up each PR's correct trail and checked all eight. #370–#376 have no findings. #377 has one real low-severity finding: in rare fallback cases, the first-query fix picks from an uncapped list of up to 3,000 files, so those cases could get slower. The gate had shown that check as passed.\n- **Fix:** that agent is back on it.\n- **Recorded:** the trail-number trap and the \"don't trust the gate's 'passed'\" rule are now in the protocol.\n\n**Still running:** the #142 rescope and the disclosure fix for the two silent gaps."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":879,"cache_read_input_tokens":414390,"output_tokens":510,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":879,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":510,"cache_read_input_tokens":414390,"cache_creation_input_tokens":879,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":879},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"2097623d-b5e0-495b-9c0a-d6acd83201c0","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgMv8XqRuvWDCLdRrkjmb","requestRef":"71cdb412-50af-4d1b-a624-cfe6fc41afbf","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"abbe0e0a-52ad-4909-a2c4-3b8015ade392","timestamp":"2026-10-24T23:18:36.741Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","session_id":"6e41b4d8-b432-41b0-bc86-517a25b228fa","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
