{"parentUuid":"a891b8db-200f-45a8-8977-818ef9adb79a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgMxTsqig2gjduS1hfzwx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**About 55% overall:** graph about 70%, Brain about 35–40%. These are my estimates, weighted by how much work is left, not a count of board rows. I also just closed two stale duplicate rows on the board.\n\n**Graph (my side), about 70%**\n- **Done:**\n  - timing study, fix list and review;\n  - cleanup, refresh and setup on all three repos;\n  - **7 fix PRs open and green**: #370–#376, covering alias search, partial clones, pipeline, tool detection, history cache and the derived-file write.\n- **In progress:**\n  - #377 (first-query fix), addressing its one review finding;\n  - the #142 rescope;\n  - the \"disclose silent gaps\" fix.\n- **Left (about 30%):**\n  - a second safety review of #372;\n  - one fix that stops Brain losing code context after each new commit;\n  - tuning how the adoption counter credits graph use;\n  - a fresh-environment check that agents actually use the graph;\n  - closing old superseded PRs;\n  - updating the overview page;\n  - the single merge handoff to you.\n\n  I'm skipping the four smallest speed items, each under 1 s, unless you want them.\n\n**Brain (other session), about 35–40%**\n- **Done:**\n  - its re-index on entire-graph and entiredb;\n  - 6 PRs green;\n  - several first-run bugs found.\n- **In progress:** the export fix that makes cli setup finish at all, instead of running for hours.\n- **Not started:** most of its speed list, including the biggest item: rebuilding indexes outside the lock, which fixes the `brief` timeouts. It's designed but not implemented.\n\n**Waiting on you**\n- yes or no on the 63 `~/Documents/Coding` folders;\n- whether to file the two cli issues;\n- the merge approvals at the end."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":879,"cache_read_input_tokens":422453,"output_tokens":605,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":879,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":605,"cache_read_input_tokens":422453,"cache_creation_input_tokens":879,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":879},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"f8a20ebd-af76-44e4-93f4-1dce2e125972","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgMxTsXd4fatSWeoV5LEV","requestRef":"33ab9496-6cd0-4ca4-97c7-ed5eb8913df0","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"d4913910-b672-42c3-a50e-d1d66cc0fba9","timestamp":"2026-10-24T23:49:13.491Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","session_id":"6e41b4d8-b432-41b0-bc86-517a25b228fa","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
