{"parentUuid":"5da95717-12f6-43e6-a653-ac9a11e027d8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgN2FoXQ1xj5jCSDnYB8v","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Every planned graph fix now has a PR: ten in total, #142 and #370–#378. All are green on CI, have no open review findings, and are waiting only on approval. That puts the graph side at about 80%.\n\n**Still left on the graph side**\n- **The independent security review of #372**, running now.\n- **The fix for Brain losing code context after every new commit.** It needs a design first.\n- **A fresh-environment check that agents actually use the graph**, plus tuning the adoption counter. Both run real Claude sessions, which costs usage, so I'll do them last.\n- **Updating the overview page.**\n- **The single merge handoff to you.**\n\n**Follow-ups noted, not started:** five smaller items the fix agents found, now on the board. For example, letting co-change history work on partial clones, and making the alias route faster on warm queries."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":292,"cache_read_input_tokens":454898,"output_tokens":270,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":292,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":270,"cache_read_input_tokens":454898,"cache_creation_input_tokens":292,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":292},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"82ec244e-0398-44af-a073-01e1797b130e","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgN2FoBof247oCJA6q71L","requestRef":"742ec985-6616-49e