s the list of files changed since, so callers can distrust those. Cheapest; correctness depends on the disclosure.\n- **(b) Incremental build.** Derive the new store from the parent's store plus the diff (re-index only changed files). Fast, but how complex is it given cross-file relations?\n- **(c) Trigger.** Rebuild in the background on commit: a Brain watch or worker, or a git hook. Does the Brain worker or daemon already exist for this?\n- **(d) Lazy.** Build on the first `brief` after a commit, with a time bound, falling back to (a).\n\nFor each: user-visible effect, correctness risk (stale relations), cost, which repo it lives in (graph lane or brain lane), and what tests would prove it.\n\n## Deliverable\n- Write the doc to `/Users/suhaan/devenv-worktrees/timing/GRAPH-STORE-PER-COMMIT-DESIGN.md`: problem, current behaviour with citations, measurements, options table, recommendation, and a split into graph-side and brain-side PRs.\n- Report back in ≤ 30 lines.\n- Do not edit either repo, open PRs, touch `~/.local/share/entire`, or run `entire brain setup|refresh|--daemon`.","outputFile":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-suhaan-devenv/6e41b4d8-b432-41b0-bc86-517a25b228fa/tasks/a8798a1b94743c507.output","canReadOutputFile":true,"canContinueAgent":true},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"aec96c3f-10b0-4cc2-b452-b20add1bd8d0","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","root":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","branch":"main","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":2},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-graph","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"entireio","host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-graph","visibility":"public"},{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-graph","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remot