{"parentUuid":"d1086404-d10c-46d3-a9e9-221eaef9ab7c","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14947472 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"932ad6fa-c9be-4fe2-b5af-ffe929a7d5b1","timestamp":"2026-10-25T00:42:43.451Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14947472 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6e41b4d8-b432-41b0-bc86-517a25b228fa","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
{"parentUuid":"932ad6fa-c9be-4fe2-b5af-ffe929a7d5b1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgN2Z5kSRdwd6jgsck4fS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The independent security review caught a real problem in #372, so I've pulled it back from \"ready\".\n\n**The problem**\n- #372 lets the graph index partial clones when git is version 2.45 or newer. It relies on a git setting that is supposed to stop git fetching missing files over the network.\n- That check only exists from **git 2.45.1**. I confirmed it in git's own source: the check is missing at v2.45.0 and present at v2.45.1.\n- The reviewer built git 2.45.0 and showed the graph still starting a network fetch. On Windows, that could reach a network share before any other safeguard kicks in.\n- **Your machine is safe:** it runs git 2.54. So is the Brain session's entiredb re-index, which ran here.\n\n**Being fixed now** (the original agent is back on #372):\n- raise the minimum to 2.45.1;\n- check the git version from inside the repo folder, because version managers like asdf/mise can swap in a different git per folder, and the reviewer showed that bypass;\n- tighten the test that catches stray ways of launching git, which currently misses some;\n- correct the wording in messages and docs.\n\n**Everything else the review checked held up:**\n- 15 hostile repo settings triggered nothing;\n- no fetches on newer git;\n- the other git-command change is byte-identical.\n\n**Corrections and lessons:**\n- I retracted the wrong \"2.45\" fact from Brain's memory, recorded the corrected one, and told the Brain session.\n- This PR had green CI, zero gate findings and its own safety proofs, and was still wrong. That's now in my notes: for any PR that loosens a safety check, verify the upstream version claim against upstream source at the exact version.\n\nIt will get a second review once the fix is in. The per-commit index design is still running."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":578,"cache_read_input_tokens":472144,"output_tokens":578,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":578,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":578,"cache_read_input_tokens":472144,"cache_creation_input_tokens":578,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":578},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"6141c6d3-4865-4c27-aa14-86c595cd2d80","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgN2Z5Lstz3F1SVdnA6ui","requestRef":"19df4f34-b732-40cf-8259-e84dd68cece4","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"758ced68-cd1e-4b8d-8b4a-4bbc8ac8a0d4","timestamp":"2026-10-25T00:42:50.684Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","session_id":"6e41b4d8-b432-41b0-bc86-517a25b228fa","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
