cords in changed files, returns a `stale` block. `graph store` stays exact.\n- B2 (brain): brief passes the flag and renders a staleness line; degrades to today's call on an older graph.\n- B3 (brain): detached build kick on miss, under a lock with cooldown.\n- Separate decision: `.brainignore` variant alignment, which would also enable a write-on-persist option.\n\nCaveats:\n- entire-brain main checkout is detached at e6bb5c42 (PR #336), which predates graph_store.go. Brain citations come from origin/main 9309afa1 via git show. Graph impact was not run on brain symbols; callers come from git grep.\n- No `brain remember` written, since that writes under ~/.local/share/entire. Worth recording later: the variant mismatch, and the daemon never reaching the code-index step."},"promptSource":"system","queueSkipSlashCommands":true,"turnOrigin":"peer","queueSkipAttachments":true,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
