{"parentUuid":"2cbee79d-9fe4-4400-a2fe-1b149f8c14b3","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14980848 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"b023bfd4-054f-4e79-84bc-38b6f4feac8a","timestamp":"2026-10-25T01:59:51.541Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14980848 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6e41b4d8-b432-41b0-bc86-517a25b228fa","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
{"parentUuid":"b023bfd4-054f-4e79-84bc-38b6f4feac8a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgN8SF7FMjqBP67McuUrd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The Brain session confirmed #372 is what's keeping Brain blind on cli and entiredb. Both refuse graph indexing today because they're partial clones, and that's the only reason entire-graph is the one repo with code context in Brain.\n\nOn cli, the partial-clone setting is on the checkpoint remote, which is named by its full URL, not on `origin`. #372 already handles that, since the live check passed on cli. I've asked the author to add a test pinning that case and to put the stronger motivation in the PR description.\n\nTwo good results from the Brain session:\n- **Faster cli refresh:** its export fix (#481) brought a real cli refresh down from about 2.4 hours to under 4 minutes.\n- **Subagents now see the graph in devenv and cli:** those two folders had no hook telling Claude's helper agents (Explore, Plan) that the graph exists. That explains much of the \"helper agents never use the graph\" problem we measured earlier. It wired the hooks in both.\n\nStill running: the final #372 fixes, the old-store cleanup and the allow-ancestor flag."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2165,"cache_read_input_tokens":511860,"output_tokens":353,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2165,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":353,"cache_read_input_tokens":511860,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2165,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2165},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"c599f40e-4e2e-4ee5-bedb-ac3158bcea1a","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgN8SEck3SuuJEe9ve4zV","requestRef":"2976ca23-0a1c-4b68-8a56-e259105ff901","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"060e9442-2044-46ee-8056-6095b7431061","timestamp":"2026-10-25T01:59:57.279Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","session_id":"6e41b4d8-b432-41b0-bc86-517a25b228fa","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
