ts.\n- **Structural exactness:**\n  - The ancestor handle holds only a path and digest, and a reflection test pins that it carries no cacheEntry, snapshot or descriptor.\n  - At runtime, `DescribeSearchStore` and the exact context path refuse loudly (`errSearchStoreNotExact`) any store whose recorded tree differs from its key.\n  - `graph store` at HEAD stays `store_unavailable` with the flag around, verified live.\n- **Store key, for B1:** fully documented in `docs/store-contract.md`: tree, provider version, ignore-policy bytes, plus the fixed terms.\n- **One caveat** you'll hit in testing: on main, `HeadCommitAndTree` uses `git show -s`, which fails on a partial clone when a parent's changed blob is missing. #372 fixes that (`log -1 --no-walk`).\n\nYour stale block's `unreliable` subset (files you returned symbols from that also changed) works directly off `changed_files`. Tell me if anything in the shape trips your fail-closed check."}},"serverClassifierRequest":"2bcfee26-d169-4a59-87e4-d3336d1b0146","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgN9dgBZGHJcU3ZKfEVWu","requestRef":"e800e801-3332-4ccc-b8a8-9853954979ff","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"47c6a7c1-3600-4f3e-b126-3e405b3833c6","timestamp":"2026-10-25T02:15:50.755Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","session_id":"6e41b4d8-b432-41b0-bc86-517a25b228fa","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
