{"parentUuid":"f9b37989-d643-4e60-bb89-c45d71dd5b63","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgN9fP6hDmF8NGGFhQCuc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I sent the Brain session a stable copy of the #380 build, plus the exact output from the live test, so it can test its side against the real thing.\n\nThe graph side now has 12 open PRs: #142 and #370–#380, all green and waiting only on approval. The last fix still running is #372's final pass (the symlink case and test hardening), and it will get one more check before handoff.\n\n**Still left after that:**\n- A fresh-environment check that agents actually use the graph, plus tuning how the adoption counter credits graph use. Both run real Claude sessions, so they cost usage.\n- An overview page update.\n- The single merge handoff to you, with every PR in order across both sides."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2204,"cache_read_input_tokens":530094,"output_tokens":214,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2204,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":214,"cache_read_input_tokens":530094,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2204,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2204},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"00cb2d4c-1c02-4406-b393-2507ebc303c0","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgN9fNgeJo1EKSrJiJE6v","requestRef":"9f3d3126-0f96-4759-9113-3a6afe3ed22a","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"5b46b1cd-e994-4d21-90ff-8a4ac1b27e5c","timestamp":"2026-10-25T02:16:01.8