{"parentUuid":"8677ff12-b2d2-45a3-a258-eea1cc949b5e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgN9sJN2sLSjJn1qakBff","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The Brain session turned the exact output from the #380 live test into a test on its own side. If the graph's output format ever changes, a test fails instead of a user. It's holding its \"ask for older commits\" switch until it can detect whether the installed graph supports the flag. I offered to have #380 report that support directly, which would make detection simple.\n\nIt also found why Brain couldn't refresh cli. In a partial clone, `entire checkpoint explain` reports \"checkpoint not found\" for checkpoints whose data simply hasn't been downloaded yet, and still exits successfully. Brain lost 186 sessions that way until it fetched the missing data.\n\nYour cli list on the board now has three issues to decide whether to file:\n- the post-commit hook using 2.8 GB of memory on every agent commit;\n- the hidden 100-checkpoint cap;\n- this \"not found\" that exits as success.\n\nStill running: #372's final review fixes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1369,"cache_read_input_tokens":534733,"output_tokens":299,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1369,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":299,"cache_read_input_tokens":534733,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1369,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1369},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"6ac285cb-4b8d-426b-bf6e-7dcafe6a275d"