{"parentUuid":"36519f05-4a08-42b0-af49-1eb52154d91e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgNBgHZqPgkuZodg9A7Pc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've started the combined test branch. It merges all 12 PRs in the planned order and resolves the two real clashes, keeping both sides' intent each time:\n- **#142 with tool detection:** it keeps the new tool detection and #142's cancellation checks.\n- **#378 with the history cache:** it keeps the new co-change warning and the faster cache update.\n\nThen it runs the full test suites, spot-checks real behaviour and timing against `main`, and pushes as a draft PR titled \"DO NOT MERGE\" so CI runs on the whole combination. The two resolutions are saved as patches, so the real #142 and #378 can reuse them when their turn comes.\n\nIt's also checking one open question: whether #378 needs its own cache version bump. Without one, old cached results could keep the silent drop that #378 fixes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5019,"cache_read_input_tokens":556074,"output_tokens":265,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5019,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":265,"cache_read_input_tokens":556074,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5019,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5019},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"b8b9d3f7-755f-4f64-85e4-b41e1ae921c6","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgNBgHBmF7xQipxn8hBFQ","requestRef":"92431ef6-457e-463b-b3c3-4d8a92e5380f","requestedModel":"claude