{"parentUuid":"84ee0664-fcc0-44e6-a79f-1ccac6a7daee","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgNCMsHwHfddeCVE7czHi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01TddsrtoQP5aBHypUq36mxk","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"P=/Users/suhaan/devenv-worktrees/timing/plugindir-380; mkdir -p $P/bin; ln -sfn /Users/suhaan/devenv-worktrees/timing/bin/eg-ancestor-edbdacb6 $P/bin/entire-graph; ln -sfn \"$(readlink -f ~/.local/share/entire/plugins/bin/entire-brain)\" $P/bin/entire-brain; ls -la $P/bin | awk 'NR>1{print $NF, \"<-\", $(NF-2)}'; [ -e $P/data ] && echo \"WARNING data present\" || echo \"no data link (correct)\"; ENTIRE_PLUGIN_DIR=$P entire graph capabilities --json 2>/dev/null | python3 -c \"import json,sys; print('host form capability:', json.load(sys.stdin)['optional_local_only_features'].get('context_allow_ancestor'))\"; ENTIRE_PLUGIN_DIR=$P entire brain version","description":"Build a plugin dir with the 380 build and verify host-form capability"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1340,"cache_read_input_tokens":561093,"output_tokens":1538,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":274},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1340,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":1538,"cache_read_input_tokens":561093,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1340,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1340},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.2.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"}],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01TddsrtoQP5aBHypUq36mxk":{"command":"P=/Users/suhaan/devenv-worktrees/timing/plugindir-380; mkdir -p $P/bin; ln -sfn /Users/suhaan/devenv-worktrees/timing/bin/eg-ancestor-edbdacb6 $P/bin/entire-graph; ln -sfn \"$(readlink -f ~/.local/share/entire/plugins/bin/entire-brain)\" $P/bin/entire-brain; ls -la $P/bin | awk 'NR>1{print $NF, \"<-\", $(NF-2)}'; [ -e $P/data ] && echo \"WARNING data present\" || echo \"no data link (correct)\"; ENTIRE_PLUGIN_DIR=$P entire graph capabilities --json 2>/dev/null | python3 -c \"import json,sys; print('host form capability:', json.load(sys.stdin)['optional_local_only_features'].get('context_allow_ancestor'))\"; ENTIRE_PLUGIN_DIR=$P entire brain version","description":"Build a plugin dir with the 380 build and verify host-form capability"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"f82eef11-6be4-4541-a1a0-b96fc5bf775a","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgNCMqyKXNZgxsMeGRchK","requestRef":"51b76ee7-35ae-4c17-ac77-77ef492e3066","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"c06e2006-9833-482c-94b8-ac54fe3bc9ed","timestamp":"2026-10-25T02:51:29.949Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","session_id":"6e41b4d8-b432-41b0-bc86-517a25b228fa","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
{"parentUuid":"c06e2006-9833-482c-94b8-ac54fe3bc9ed","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgNCMsHwHfddeCVE7czHi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01SNed2TLmg5hyh1zcXd62kA","name":"SendMessage","input":{"to":"fix-brain-initialization-ux","summary":"Plugin dir for #380 ready now; my --graph-binary tip was wrong","message":"You're right, and my `--graph-binary` suggestion was wrong for exactly the reason you found. Brain speaks the host verb (`graph …`), and a bare plugin binary only takes the plugin form. Not trying both forms is the right call; a half-resolved provider is worse than an honest fail-closed.\n\n**You don't need to wait for #380 to land.** Nothing merges until Suhaan does the single handoff, so the end-to-end pass is more useful now. I built a plugin dir for the #380 head:\n```\nENTIRE_PLUGIN_DIR=/Users/suhaan/devenv-worktrees/timing/plugindir-380\n  bin/entire-graph -> timing/bin/eg-ancestor-edbdacb6   (#380 @ edbdacb6)\n  bin/entire-brain -> your installed _durable/entire-brain\n  (NO data link)\n```\nVerified through the host form: `ENTIRE_PLUGIN_DIR=… entire graph capabilities --json` reports `context_allow_ancestor: true`, and `entire brain version` is your nightly.\n\nAs before, for a run against the real store, add `data -> ~/.local/share/entire/plugins/data` for the run only, confirm `brain_store` with `entire brain config show` before writing, and remove the link afterwards. Without it you'd get a fresh empty store, which is the false green we already avoided once.\n\nTo exercise the stale path you need a store at an ancestor and none at HEAD. Index at HEAD~1 under that plugin dir with `ENTIRE_GRAPH_SEARCH_STORE=1`, then brief at HEAD. Easiest on a scratch clone rather than a real repo.","type":"message","recipient":"fix-brain-initialization-ux","recipient_kind":"name","content":"You're right, and my `--graph-binary` suggestion …"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1340,"cache_read_input_tokens":561093,"output_tokens":1538,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":274},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1340,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":1538,"cache_read_input_tokens":561093,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1340,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1340},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.2.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"}],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01SNed2TLmg5hyh1zcXd62kA":{"to":"fix-brain-initialization-ux","summary":"Plugin dir for #380 ready now; my --graph-binary tip was wrong","message":"You're right, and my `--graph-binary` suggestion was wrong for exactly the reason you found. Brain speaks the host verb (`graph …`), and a bare plugin binary only takes the plugin form. Not trying both forms is the right call; a half-resolved provider is worse than an honest fail-closed.\n\n**You don't need to wait for #380 to land.** Nothing merges until Suhaan does the single handoff, so the end-to-end pass is more useful now. I built a plugin dir for the #380 head:\n```\nENTIRE_PLUGIN_DIR=/Users/suhaan/devenv-worktrees/timing/plugindir-380\n  bin/entire-graph -> timing/bin/eg-ancestor-edbdacb6   (#380 @ edbdacb6)\n  bin/entire-brain -> your installed _durable/entire-brain\n  (NO data link)\n```\nVerified through the host form: `ENTIRE_PLUGIN_DIR=… entire graph capabilities --json` reports `context_allow_ancestor: true`, and `entire brain version` is your nightly.\n\nAs before, for a run against the real store, add `data -> ~/.local/share/entire/plugins/data` for the run only, confirm `brain_store` with `entire brain config show` before writing, and remove the link afterwards. Without it you'd get a fresh empty store, which is the false green we already avoided once.\n\nTo exercise the stale path you need a store at an ancestor and none at HEAD. Index at HEAD~1 under that plugin dir with `ENTIRE_GRAPH_SEARCH_STORE=1`, then brief at HEAD. Easiest on a scratch clone rather than a real repo."}},"serverClassifierRequest":"f82eef11-6be4-4541-a1a0-b96fc5bf775a","apiBlockIndex":3,"requestId":"req_011CgNCMqyKXNZgxsMeGRchK","requestRef":"51b76ee7-35ae-4c17-ac77-77ef492e3066","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"eb0abc83-d9cc-44ce-892d-961314328b15","timestamp":"2026-10-25T02:51:35.624Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","session_id":"6e41b4d8-b432-41b0-bc86-517a25b228fa","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
