{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","hash":"4247e8d49a853825c50460056b6723d4c83f8ba2595d7ffe8c2d4f7dffae500c","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"#378 is done:\n- **Both cache versions are bumped:** v23 for the records cache and v28 for the search cache.\n- **The new test shows old saved results are no longer served:** that covers the `graph context` and `graph store` paths Brain reads through.\n- **CI is green, and the finding is resolved,** with a note saying the review was right.\n\nThe combined test branch was built before this change, so I'm refreshing it with the new #378 and re-running CI. The cache version clashes with #374 have to resolve the right way."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01YAH6qgg8WhLbs22MsDooSm","name":"SendMessage","input":{"to":"aabe72c829f22357b","summary":"Refresh #381 with new #378 head (v23/v28)","message":"Refresh the integration branch with #378's new head. #378 is now at **a2447218**. It adds a records-cache bump to **v23** and a search-snapshot bump to **v28**, each commented \"follows #374's v22/v27\".\n\n1. Fetch `pull/378/head`, then merge it into `integration/g3-all` with `--no-ff`. The other 11 PR heads are unchanged; check them quickly against `gh pr view <N> --json headRefOid` and merge in any that moved.\n2. The version constants will conflict with #374's v22/v27. Resolve them to **v23 and v28**. Check nothing else regressed: your 375-x-378 and 142-x-378 resolutions must still hold.\n3. Re-run, under mlock: build, vet, and the cache, records, co-change and splice tests plus #378's two new bump tests with `-race`, plus the full `internal/sem` with `-p 1`.\n4. Push (it's your branch, so no force needed; it's a new merge commit), and watch #381's CI to a result.\n5. Update `.g3/resolutions/` with a `374-x-378-versions.patch`, and update the #381 body.\n\nReport in ≤ 12 lines."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0152ZBcYHjESXcd7TpCgLEW8","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport json, datetime, fcntl, os\nlock=open('/Users/suhaan/devenv/.claude/todo-board.lock','a'); fcntl.flock(lock, fcntl.LOCK_EX)\np='/Users/suhaan/devenv/.claude/todo-board.json'\nd=json.load(open(p)); T={t['id']:t for t in d['tasks']}\nT['G3-C1']['note']=T['G3-C1']['note'].replace('→ bumping to v28 now.','→ a2447218: search snapshot v28 (+ store/context test), finding resolved with reasoning; CI green.')\nT['D4-handoff']['note']+=' | #378 rebase now also resolves version constants to records v23 / search v28 (after #374\\'s v22/v27). Refreshing #381 with it.'\nd['updated']=datetime.datetime.now().strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S')\ntmp=p+'.tmp'; json.dump(d,open(tmp,'w'),indent=2); os.replace(tmp,p); print('ok')\nEOF","description":"Record the 378 v28 result on the board"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
